    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "well i dont want to make a big deal out of it or waste the doctors time if it's just the heat. it only happened once and i feel okay now that i'm sitting down. i've been feeling a bit dizzy lately too, maybe i'm just low on electrolytes? would it be okay if i just took some extra magnesium or maybe a higher dose of salt water to help get my levels back up?",
